{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"body":"Remediation: added a rebar-ticket trailer to the two implementing commits and rebased the branch above them. All three commit trees are byte-identical to their originals, only messages changed. d3f710f became d870d16, 6edfae3 became f11f294, afdf6d0 became d7b30a1, with backup refs kept at backup/adevx-133, backup/adevx-134 and backup/adevx-135."},"env_id":"8c3ef925-fbdc-4d88-8d59-f391cf59568c","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1789936220688826001,"uuid":"60dc94bf-eb11-4957-bcfc-f85d030c191d"}